      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: no_little_asian; hasOverallIntent: Hateful; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a group of East Asian individuals enjoying street food, juxtaposed with the text 'no little asian' and 'don't eat them raw.' This text is a direct reference to the harmful and racist stereotype that East Asians eat dogs, which is a false and offensive generalization. The meme uses the visual of happy, normal people to contrast with the hateful, derogatory text, thereby reinforcing a harmful racial trope. The intent is to perpetuate a stereotype that dehumanizes and mocks a specific ethnic group based on a false and offensive claim, making it a hateful meme.",
