      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "intended audience",
      "description": "The meme is designed for an audience that is familiar with or perpetuates anti-Asian racist stereotypes, particularly those related to the 'dog-eating' trope and the 'no little asian' insult. The target audience likely includes individuals who find humor or satisfaction in racially degrading content, or who are unaware of the harmful nature of these stereotypes. The visual of happy East Asian individuals is used to contrast with the hateful text, which may appeal to viewers who enjoy or are conditioned to accept such racially charged humor. The meme's intent to reinforce harmful tropes suggests it targets communities that either actively promote or are indifferent to anti-Asian racism.",
